Package: aurora-neo-platform-config
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: MacBook Neo NetworkManager and trackpad configuration (Aurora)
 Configuration for the MacBook Neo (J700), scoped to its hardware so that it
 does nothing on other Macs: a NetworkManager snippet that matches only the
 mt7932-fullmac Wi-Fi driver (no scan MAC randomisation, the permanent MAC
 address) and libinput quirks for the J700 trackpad.
